Cart -> Placed
Placed -> Payment pending
Payment pending -> Paid, Payment failed
Payment failed -> Payment pending
Payment failed -> Cancelled
Paid -> Picking
Picking -> Packed, Out of stock
Out of stock -> Refunded
Packed -> Shipped
Shipped -> Delivered, Lost in transit
Lost in transit -> Picking
Delivered -> Return requested
Return requested -> Refunded
Placed -> Cancelled
Refunded -> Closed
Cancelled -> Closed
Delivered -> Closed
